TITLE:: RCSong
summary:: One song: identity, seed, layers, server topology and resources
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Guides/reCurrent, Classes/RCSession, Classes/RCLayer, Classes/RCOrgnsmRegistry, Classes/RCOsc, Classes/RCMidi

DESCRIPTION::
Replaces the per-song globals of the proto-library: song name and seed, the beat environments (now link::Classes/RCLayer::s), the global out/group arrays, the orgnsm registry and the group variables. A song registers itself in the session; creating a song with an existing name frees the previous one.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
argument:: name
A Symbol, used in OSC paths (code::/<name>/...::) and beat names.
argument:: seed
Default random seed for every streamed attribute of every beat.
argument:: session
Defaults to link::Classes/RCSession#*default::.
argument:: layerKeys
Layers created at construction, code::#[\core, \details, \meta]:: by default.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: layer
argument:: key
The link::Classes/RCLayer::, or nil (with a warning).
METHOD:: addLayer
argument:: key
argument:: clock
argument:: swing
argument:: midiOut
argument:: addMidiOuts

METHOD:: outArray
METHOD:: groupArray
METHOD:: inChanArray
METHOD:: fobjectOutArray
METHOD:: fobjectGroupArray
Arrays indexed by code::orgnsm_out_idx::, code::orgnsm_group_idx::, loop buffer input index and fobject create() indices. An index outside the array is reported and falls back (out 0, default group).

METHOD:: makeGroups
Standard node tree: code::\in:: → code::\sounds:: { code::\orgnsms:: (ParGroup), code::\fobjects:: (ParGroup) } → code::\background:: → code::\outputDecode::. Sets code::groupArray:: and code::fobjectGroupArray::. Needs a running server.
METHOD:: group
argument:: role
METHOD:: releaseAll
code::group.set(\gate, 0):: on a group (default code::\sounds::): the clean panic.
METHOD:: freeAllNodes

METHOD:: registry
The link::Classes/RCOrgnsmRegistry::.
METHOD:: osc
The link::Classes/RCOsc::.
METHOD:: midi
The link::Classes/RCMidi::.
METHOD:: makeKeyboard
argument:: deviceName
argument:: staleTimeout
A link::Classes/RCKeyboardState:: for an MPE keyboard.
METHOD:: keyboard

METHOD:: loopBuffer
argument:: key
METHOD:: sampleLibrary
A code::MultiLevelIdentityDictionary:: of buffers (see link::Classes/RCUtil#*fileTree::), freed by code::clearAll::.

METHOD:: addOutput
argument:: key
argument:: output
An output chain (link::Classes/RAOutputChain::, or anything answering code::build(parentGroup):: and code::clear::) under a name; an existing one under that name is cleared first. Registered unbuilt: its configuration is valid before code::buildOutputs::.
METHOD:: output
argument:: key
METHOD:: ambi
The output registered as code::\main::.
METHOD:: buildOutputs
argument:: parent
Builds every output inside code::parent:: (the code::\outputDecode:: group by default), after code::makeGroups::.
METHOD:: outputs

METHOD:: addRecorder
argument:: key
argument:: recorder
An link::Classes/RERecorder:: (or anything answering code::free::, and code::clock:: / code::clock_::: the song's clock is adopted when it has none); a previous one under the name is freed.
METHOD:: recorder
argument:: key
METHOD:: recorders
METHOD:: addReplay
argument:: key
argument:: replay
An link::Classes/REReplay::, same rules.
METHOD:: replay
argument:: key
METHOD:: replays

METHOD:: allBeats
METHOD:: killAllBeats
METHOD:: clearAll
Everything a scene/init re-creates: beats, orgnsms, fobjects, loop buffers, sample library, recorders, replays, output chains (cleared, kept registered), groups. OSC and MIDI definitions survive.
argument:: freeGroups
METHOD:: free
